From ecf01a5a4a25473eb8b944dfc51c12d9672ef01e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 31 Jul 2026 14:59:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Apply portfolio enhancements across SEO, accessibility,
 and UX
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Add opengraph-image.tsx: generates a 1200x630 OG card so LinkedIn/Twitter previews show a real image instead of blank
- Add sitemap.ts and robots.ts: exposes /sitemap.xml and /robots.txt for search engine discovery of all 7 routes
- Add JSON-LD Person schema to layout: name, jobTitle, sameAs (GitHub + LinkedIn) for Google rich results
- Fix chat history: API route now reads and injects the last 6 turns into the Groq messages array so follow-up questions are coherent
- Add contact form: name/email/message fields posting to new /api/contact route (Resend); success and error states handled
- Fix French i18n: restore all missing accents (étudiant, développeur, précédent, Séquence, métropole, etc.) across PAGE_COPY, HOME_COPY, and GENERIC_COPY
- Add aria-live="polite" to ChatWidget message list so screen readers announce new assistant replies
- Add error.tsx: branded 500 page with try-again and go-home actions
- Add not-found.tsx: branded 404 page consistent with site design
- Add loading.tsx: animated bounce dots shown during route transitions on slow connections

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VcEoceqxMDTGdsAMXZxeDw
